		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Incredibly beautiful demon who seduces and beguiles mortals for their master.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 29, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 kiss +4 (1d6 + drain) or 1 charm, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Change Shape</strong>. In place of attacks, transform into any similarly-sized humanoid.</p><p></p><p><strong>Charm</strong>. One humanoid in near CHA 15+ or bewitched by succubus for 1d6 hours.</p><p></p><p><strong>Drain</strong>. The target takes 1d6 WIS damage. A target reduced to 0 WIS this way swears its soul to a demon lord.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
